# PLO_OTHERPLPROPS with the other player's level (prop 20) and full look: one-byte and two-byte id
waitsession 240
wait s2c 9 90
sleep 8
shot ref
mark row pl8-1byte-lvl
s2c 8 c:7 c:0 str:one c:20 str:{LEVEL} c:15 c:52 c:16 c:60 c:17 c:2 c:13 c:1 c:2 c:3 c:4 c:5 c:11 c:3
sleep 3
shot pl8-1byte-lvl
mark row pl8-2byte-lvl
s2c 8 s:9 c:0 str:two c:20 str:{LEVEL} c:15 c:70 c:16 c:60 c:17 c:2 c:13 c:1 c:2 c:3 c:4 c:5 c:11 c:3
sleep 3
shot pl8-2byte-lvl
mark row pl8-lvl-first
s2c 8 s:11 c:20 str:{LEVEL} c:0 str:three c:15 c:60 c:16 c:56 c:17 c:2
sleep 3
shot pl8-lvl-first
sleep 2
shot final
